@node gpui-ios Manual
@chapter Crate @code{gpui-ios}
@cindex gpui-ios

@code{gpui-ios} is the iOS platform backend for GPUI. It enables any
GPUI application -- including the SotF desktop player -- to run
natively on iOS with Metal rendering, touch input, momentum scrolling
and software keyboard support. Vendored from
@uref{https://github.com/itsbalamurali/gpui-mobile, gpui-mobile} and
adapted to the SotF-tracked GPUI revision.

